<title>USA: IntegraMed acquires fertility service.</title>
<headline>IntegraMed acquires fertility service.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>IntegraMed America Inc said on Tuesday that it had closed an asset acquisition agreement with California's Reproductive Sciences Center in a move to further expand operations on the West Coast.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement and the acquisition price were not disclosed.</p>
<p>In addition, IntegraMed said it had entered into a management agreement with RSC, a provider of infertility and assisted reproductive technology services.</p>
<p>IntegraMed provides management support services to medical providers of women's health care services.</p>
